== Effects ==
* Grants a random rune effect. 
** {{dlc+|a+nr}} {{p|Black Rune}} is excluded.{{dlc-}}
** {{p|Rune Shard}} is excluded.
* Has a 25% chance to drop another Blank Rune on the ground upon use.

== Notes ==
* The random rune effect can be from a rune that hasn't been unlocked yet.
* {{dlc|r}} Blank Rune cannot replicate the effects of [[Soul Stone]]s.

== Strategy ==
* The two most valuable rune effects from Blank Rune are {{p|Perthro}}, for a re-roll, or {{p|Ehwaz}}, for a {{r|Crawl Space}} which has a high chance of containing a free item. Therefore, the best use of Blank Rune is in a room with an item while also standing over a [[We Need To Go Deeper!|tile with a special graphic]]. {{dlc+|r}} Using Blank Rune in a room with an item pedestal also has the chance to activate {{p|Black Rune}}, exchanging the item for stats.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|nr}}: Activates two random rune effects. Attempts to spawn additional Blank Rune twice.

